4) Security Rules (Firestore – sketch)
•	suppliers read: public
•	suppliers write: admins only, or listing owner after claim
•	reviews create: authenticated users; update/delete: author or admin
•	plans read/write: only owner userId == request.auth.uid

(Have Copilot generate the exact Firebase rules from these constraints.)
 
