9) Planner ↔ Directory Matching Logic

Input: selectedProducts: string[] from planner (e.g., ["tomato-starts","perennials","compost"])
Query: suppliers.where("products","array-contains-any", selectedProducts)
Post-filter: by city/lat-lng radius, by services if user toggled “delivery/install”
Sort: premium first, then distance, then rating
 
